g/wiki/Yhonzae_Pierre"},"pick":{"pick":21,"round":1,"team":"PIT","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Yhonzae Pierre","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yhonzae_Pierre","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:21Z","intro":"Yhonzae Pierre (born October 13, 2004) is an American college football linebacker for the Alabama Crimson Tide.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Pierre attended Eufaula High School in Eufaula, Alabama. He was selected to the 2023 All-American Bowl. A five-star recruit, he committed to the University of Alabama to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"After redshirting his first year at Alabama in 2023, Pierre played in 11 games his freshman year in 2024 and had six tackles. As a redshirt sophomore in 2025, he became a starter after numerous injuries and recorded three sacks against the 2025 Tennessee Volunteers. He finished with eight sacks total."}]}}